    rationale "en" "Blinded rubric adjudication, third tie-break pass: the two prior blinded passes each chose a different defensible target; this pass resolved the tie-break. Evidence: designation text ('Absorberande förband med superabsorbent'). Omissions recorded: superabsorbent material restriction explicitly stated in the source."
}
